       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. SUMONETON.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 I      PIC 9(4).
       01 TOTAL  PIC 9(8) VALUE 0.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > 100
               ADD I TO TOTAL
           END-PERFORM
           DISPLAY "Sum 1..100 = " TOTAL
           STOP RUN.
